														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4524375">
									

<p>Well if you're terrified of the idea the universe ending, just remember that the whole theory we have of the heat death is just a placeholder because we don't know exactly where energy comes from or how to better efficiently generate it. Its basically the modern equivalent of people being afraid of falling into the void if they go off the edge of the map.<br />
The downside to this is that it means the true horror of life is actually that it doesn't stop, or can be stopped, since &quot;matter cannot be created or destroyed&quot;. Life just continues in a endless parade of suffering with no escape but to struggle against it.</p>
<p>Nhilism is luxury we can't afford. However I think your on to something about a malevolent entity using entropy to kill the world. do you mind if I reference your entry in my own work? I was thinking of making my own SCP based on the idea of the jealous nothingness before time versus the endless chaos that birthed the world</p>

							</div>

								
					
